  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0c5cbb483bddf4c478998c8960188805, type: 3}
  m_Name: L4_TheShadowTalk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Lines:
  - "So, we\u2019re back. Back to the very spot where the 'Click' became a curse."
  - "Look at this sun, Minh. It\u2019s disgusting how beautiful it is, isn't it?"
  - As if the universe didn't even notice that your heart stopped beating right here,
    on this very bench.
  - "They told you to 'be normal'. Mom and Dad want their high-achiever back. Your
    sister? She\u2019s just too scared to be broken like we are."
  - "What? You\u2019re looking at me like I\u2019m the monster? I am the only part
    of you that didn't lie!"
  - Look...
  - "I\u2019m not the monster, Minh. I\u2019m just the only part of you that stayed
    in the dark room when everyone else walked away."
  - "But I\u2019m tired. I\u2019m so tired of crying red tears and holding this heavy
    camera. We\u2019re running out of film."
  - "It\u2019s time to decide. Do we let the sun finally set and walk back to a world
    that doesn't understand us?"
  - Or do we stay here? Frozen in this perfect moment, before everything went wrong?
  - Just give me the word, 'shutter-bug'. Do we move on... or do we stay?
